[img]http://cdn.edgecast.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/11979932/b81fe3e5ddd99f71e97eec8b621400bc164db667.jpg[/img]

Hi everyone!

2018 is here, and we are entering it in the best possible way for our amazing community - with more Starpoint Gemini Warlords improvements!
As we wrote multiple times, we are going to support Starpoint Gemini Warlords for quite some time, and the new update proves our point. All right, let's get straight to the business!
[list]
[*]Script bug fix which caused crash to desktop in some rare cases;
[*]Several scrip fixes which may have caused some instability in the game;
[*]Script fixes which may have caused issues following game load in the campaign;
[*]Starchart optimization. The Starchart should now work a lot faster, even on lower-end computers;
[*]Memory optimizations;
[*]Fixes and optimizations to low-res textures usage on lower-end computers;
[*]Database changes related to factions modding.
[/list]

As always, following the patch release please let us know if you notice some errors or instabilities. We always thoroughly test our updates, but some stuff could get under the radar. That things happen.
All errors and instabilities can be reported to [url= http://steamcommunity.com/app/419480/discussions/8/]Bugs and Technical Support subforum[/url], and to our customer support email: customersupport[at]starpointgemini[dot]com.
Finally - fasten your seatbelt because we'll have more exciting stuff to announce, and soon. Stay tuned!
Safe travels captains!

